;; Default BIST (built-in self-test) constants.
;; Mirrors the Rust `kami-dft::bist` module (retired kami-dft crate,
;; kotoba-lang/kami-engine, deleted PR #82) and `dft.bist/defaults`
;; (loaded at runtime; a `:cljs` literal fallback lives alongside it).
;;
;; :bist/march-elements — number of march elements (read/write
;; operations per address) per March algorithm variant, per
;; `MarchAlgorithm::march_elements` (Rust).
;;
;; :bist/mbist-overhead-cycles — fixed init/done FSM overhead added to
;; MBIST test time, independent of memory size or algorithm.
;;
;; :bist/mbist-extra-states — FSM states beyond one-per-march-element
;; (init + compare + done).
;;
;; :bist/lbist-patterns-per-chain — standard LBIST test depth: pseudo-
;; random patterns applied per scan chain.
{:bist/march-elements {:march-c 10
                        :march-c-minus 10
                        :march-b 17
                        :march-a 15
                        :checkerboard 4}
 :bist/mbist-overhead-cycles 10
 :bist/mbist-extra-states 3
 :bist/lbist-patterns-per-chain 1024}
